Package: termlook
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: T0ks1k24 <toksamal2004@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libgtk-3-0t64 (>= 3.24), libvte-2.91-0 (>= 0.62), librsvg2-common
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Homepage: https://github.com/T0ks1k24/TermLook
Description: Terminal with workspaces and split panes
 A native Rust, GTK and VTE terminal with workspace navigation, up to four panes per tab,
 configurable appearance, lazy session restoration and optional tray support.
 Runs the user's installed shell and commands directly on the host.
